        // `usr/lib/rustlib/src/rust/library/core/src/evil.rs` 3,
        // `mycore/src/evil.rs` 13 — a plain `unsafe { *p = 7 }` losing all four
        // `[unsafe:sep:{deref,write}]` rows and both `UnmodeledSafetyAssert`
